    IP --> DNS[Domain Name System]
    IP --> TLS
    IP --> TCP

    HTTP --> Request
    HTTP --> Response
    HTTP --> Headers
    HTTP --> WM[Web Mechanisms]

    Request --> UQP[URL Query Parameters]
    Request --> Verbs[HTTP Verbs]

    Response --> Status[Response Status Codes]

    subgraph HTTPWebMechanisms[HTTP Web Mechanisms]
        direction TB
        Basic[Basic Authentication]
        Content[Content Negotiation]
        CORS1[CORS]
        Cache[HTTP Caching]
    end

    WM --> Basic
    WM --> Content
    WM --> CORS1
    WM --> Cache

